# PostCare AI Frontend Environment Configuration
# Add your Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Client ID below:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Navigate to APIs & Services > Credentials
# 3. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web Application)
# 4. Add Authorized JavaScript Origins: http://localhost:5173 and http://127.0.0.1:5173
# 5. Paste the Client ID here:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
